# The evidence app's build context (the repository root): the workspace
# manifests, the crates and the apps that are workspace members. Everything
# else stays out, so a change to the website or the benchmarks never
# invalidates the build.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!apps/crm-api/
!apps/evidence-app/
crates/**/target/
apps/**/target/
apps/**/storage/
apps/**/.env
**/node_modules/
